    "notes": {
        "e5000005-0000-4000-8000-0000000000ff": {
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- Appmixer account: auth+hubspot@appmixer.com (service appmixer:hubspot), HubSpot portal 148964607 (developer test account).\n- The HubSpot app's webhook target URL must point at this Appmixer instance (own app: appId + apiKey in the service config) — the triggers register / re-activate their subscriptions at flow start.\n- UpdatedDeal re-activates the default deal.propertyChange subscriptions if they were switched off in the HubSpot app; NewDeal does the same for `deal.creation`, so the creation-time events are dropped — UpdatedDeal must fire on the amount update only (its Assert expects amount 250).\n- The cleanup after AfterAll deletes the deal by the UpdatedDeal output: UpdatedDeal always fires last (a minute after NewDeal), so its lane is the one that completes AfterAll.\n- The Waits must stay: subscription propagation and create → update spacing.",
